#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:8
msgid "诊断和调试"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:10
msgid "先检查返回错误、编译 profile，以及配置对应的精确 workspace 需求。协议不安装内部日志或平台诊断 backend。"
msgstr ""
"Start with the returned error, the compiled profile, and the exact configuration/workspace requirements."
" The protocol does not install an internal logging or platform diagnostics backend."

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:12
msgid "初始化"
msgstr "Initialization"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:14
msgid ""
"检查头文件与静态库是否来自同一 SDK 安装前缀，节点/peer/TX 容量是否有效，路由回调是否齐全，RX 容量是否覆盖完整帧上限。Workspace 地址和大小必须满足 "
"`xgl_memory_requirements()`。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the headers and static library come from the same SDK installation prefix. Verify the node "
"ID, peer and TX capacities, route callbacks and RX capacity for the complete frame limit. Workspace "
"size and address must satisfy `xgl_memory_requirements()`."

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"保证配置及引用对象持续有效。`xgl_init_static()` 和 `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` 的 `xgl_init_allocated()` 成功后均返回可立即使用的实例。禁用 libc "
"回退的构建需要向分配初始化函数提供显式 allocator。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the configuration and its referenced objects alive. `xgl_init_static()` and `xgl_init_allocated()` "
"from `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` both return ready instances on success. Builds with libc fallback disabled "
"require an explicit allocator for allocated initialization."

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "发送和接收"
msgstr "Send and Receive"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "现象或状态"
msgstr "Symptom/status"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "检查项"
msgstr "Check"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_WINDOW_FULL`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_WINDOW_FULL`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "Peer 在途窗口；继续 step 接收 ACK"
msgstr "Peer in-flight window; keep stepping to receive ACKs"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_NO_MEMORY`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_NO_MEMORY`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "Peer、全局 TX 和乱序 RX 的容量及接纳预算"
msgstr "Peer and packet pool capacity"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_BUSY`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_BUSY`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "PHY、应用接纳，或 peer 已有待推进消息"
msgstr "PHY, application admission, or an already pending peer message"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_ROUTE_NOT_FOUND`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_ROUTE_NOT_FOUND`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "目标与固定路由配置"
msgstr "Target and fixed route configuration"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "Workspace、RX cache、完整帧开销或消息上限"
msgstr "Workspace, RX cache, full frame overhead, or message limit"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "编译 profile 与请求功能"
msgstr "Compiled profile and requested feature"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_INVALID_VERSION`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_INVALID_VERSION`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "高级选项描述符的尺寸或版本、接收的 Wire 版本"
msgstr "Extended options descriptor sizes or version, or received Wire version"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "`XGL_ERR_ACK_TIMEOUT`"
msgstr "`XGL_ERR_ACK_TIMEOUT`"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:0
msgid "链路丢失、step 未推进或可靠 scope 已失败"
msgstr "Lost traffic, blocked stepping, or a failed reliable scope"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:31
msgid "确认 PHY RX 无数据时返回零字节，不越过缓冲容量，也不无限阻塞。完整序列化帧须满足两端限制。本地发送成功不是交付回执。"
msgstr ""
"Verify that PHY RX returns zero bytes when empty, never exceeds its buffer capacity, and does not block "
"indefinitely. Ensure serialized frame length fits both endpoint limits. A local send success is not a "
"delivery receipt."

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid "诊断和回调"
msgstr "Diagnostics and Callbacks"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:35
msgid ""
"在相同的实例串行化策略下使用 `<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` 的 `xgl_stats_get()`、`xgl_stats_reset()` 和应用 "
"`error_callback`。Boot 诊断文本裁剪后可记录数值状态。"
msgstr ""
"Under the same instance serialization policy, use `xgl_stats_get()` and `xgl_stats_reset()` from "
"`<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` along with the application `error_callback`. On Boot, log numeric status codes"
" when diagnostic strings are compiled out."

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:37
msgid "回调不能重入或销毁实例，应将恢复动作推迟到返回后。应用 BUSY 不能通过丢弃已被协议接纳到自有存储的数据来“解决”。"
msgstr ""
"Callbacks cannot reenter or destroy the instance. Queue recovery for after return. Application BUSY must"
" not be “fixed” by discarding a pointer whose data was already accepted into owned protocol storage."

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "恢复"
msgstr "Recovery"

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:41
msgid ""
"可靠 scope 失败后须显式退役并使用新 epoch。未认证 peer 协调排空旧流量后使用 `xgl_close_peer()`；认证会话通过 `xgl_close_security_session()`"
" 关闭，并安装新的可信参数。"
msgstr ""
"A failed reliable scope requires explicit retirement and a new epoch. Close unauthenticated peers with "
"`xgl_close_peer()` after coordinating stale-traffic draining. Close authenticated sessions through "
"`xgl_close_security_session()` and install fresh trusted parameters."

#: docs/zh/guides/troubleshooting.md:43
msgid "只有上板失败时，检查最终链接 map、调用链栈深、驱动半帧发送、DMA 生命周期、中断并发和时间源。"
msgstr ""
"If failures appear only on hardware, compare the final linker map, call-stack depth, driver partial-send"
" behavior, DMA lifetime, interrupt concurrency, and clock source."
